  "details": "Please add a private text chat between friends, with a \"Message\" button on their profile, so you can talk to them even if you're not in the same instance.\n\nThe closest thing we have now is invite messages, but they have a character limit and you can only edit them so many times, so you can't really hold a conversation with them. So everyone uses Discord instead. On desktop that's fine. In VR it means going through the SteamVR overlay to Discord every time you want to say something, which breaks the flow, and on standalone Quest it's even less convenient.\n\nIt would make sense to keep it friends only, and being able to use VRC+ emojis, stickers and images in the chat would fit really well with what's already there. And for anyone who doesn't want it, there should be a way to mute a chat or turn messages off entirely.",
